OL,3,GNEWSACulture hub set to open after
OL,4,Amajor revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA building that stood empty for years
OL,7,Fis due to open as a culture hub after a
OL,8,Fmultimillion-pound redevelopment.
OL,10,FBusinesses in Maryport were given a
OL,11,Fsneak peek of The Carlton this week, a
OL,12,Fformer cinema and bank built in the
OL,13,F1830s in the heart of the conservation
OL,14,Farea.
OL,16,FThe building's bar and cafe area is
OL,17,Fscheduled to open in mid-September,
OL,18,Fwith events expected to be scheduled
OL,19,Ffrom autumn, according to Cumberland
OL,20,FCouncil, which is leading the project.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
